  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/10/22/solana-completes-alpenglow-upgrade-here-s-what-it-means-for-users\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Solana\u2019s biggest network change since 2020 is live. Here\u2019s how users benefit</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-10-22-chainlink-partners-with-lg-cns-423993\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chainlink partners with LG CNS to drive Korean won stablecoin expansion</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/22/crypto-custody-specialist-fireblocks-denies-its-in-talks-to-be-acquired-by-visa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Crypto custody specialist Fireblocks denies it&#x27;s in talks to be acquired by Visa</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
